{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Fire from upon the altar.</b> He warned him lest he err in panic and bring strange fire, as Nadav and Avihu did, etc." "<b>And put incense.</b> To make known to them that you are a priest — and the incense that kills when it is not in a priest's hand gives life in the hands of priests." "<b>And make atonement for them.</b> The smoke of the incense interposes before the plague."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:20.839065385Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}